WEBVTT

00:00:00.299 --> 00:00:03.413
This is a fictional proposal-review exercise. The first

00:00:03.584 --> 00:00:06.571
statement says: I used an AI tool. It

00:00:06.613 --> 00:00:08.661
names an activity, but it does not show

00:00:08.747 --> 00:00:10.705
what the person can do. The retained teaching

00:00:10.833 --> 00:00:14.887
evidence includes a scope note, fictional inputs, two

00:00:14.972 --> 00:00:18.705
drafts, a review checklist and a corrected walkthrough.

00:00:19.281 --> 00:00:22.311
A supported statement is: I designed and tested

00:00:22.396 --> 00:00:26.201
a reviewed proposal workflow using fictional cases. The

00:00:26.243 --> 00:00:28.931
person can show the draft comparison and explain

00:00:29.145 --> 00:00:31.363
why a missing delivery date must remain a

00:00:31.406 --> 00:00:34.862
question. The limit belongs beside the statement: this

00:00:34.905 --> 00:00:37.763
was fictional practice, with no real customer outcome

00:00:37.934 --> 00:00:40.898
or organizational sending permission. Do not add an

00:00:40.940 --> 00:00:44.140
expert title or measured savings. For your project,

00:00:44.481 --> 00:00:46.785
choose the verb your evidence supports and open

00:00:46.913 --> 00:00:48.272
the work that proves the claim.
